    "answer": "one-breath | chug!/drink!",
    "mnemonic": "It's weird to think of having <kanji>one</kanji> <kanji>energy</kanji>. But, what gives you energy? You do it one time every couple of seconds. That would be taking breaths. So, \"one energy\" is <vocabulary>one breath</vocabulary>.",
